  "name": "veloren",
  "description": "A high-performance voxel-based RPG engine written in Rust, utilizing the specs Entity Component System to manage complex game state across distributed client-server nodes. It employs a specialized rendering pipeline leveraging WGPU for cross-platform hardware acceleration, alongside sophisticated procedural generation pipelines for large-scale terrain, climate, and economic simulation. The architecture is highly modular, integrating custom networking protocols, advanced asset management via RON-based manifests, and Nix-based build reproducibility for cross-architecture deployments.",
